  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:37a080456d4de4425e9bd3db",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "爱丽速子的胜利和跑姿\n让观众席爆出欢呼声。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8942554fec30e1c24d60a4167d550c88da655e3e5b17befdb4ba3a0d7c0acbee",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1032/storytimeline_501032426.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d3b4a2cf86754f9e804d65f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "爱丽速子发现她借由粉丝的声援，\n能够发挥出比平常还要好的实力。\n这个意料之外的结果让她十分兴奋。",
      "source_fingerprint": "65bbc78417a237977050fa5c70de58aed8fda178beeb7b7cb023f58ff77ff032",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1032/storytimeline_501032426.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52e2e74d57004a437b081735",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "今年的目标比赛剩下\n“天皇赏（秋）”和“有马纪念”。\n她正一步步接近“极限的前方”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4430383e51cc17d13ae1598c3bbc5e5ac5ffae359f458a860909eafee1be132f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1032/storytimeline_501032426.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b6001581707b67128c0eeeaf",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "宝冢纪念结束后・声援的成分",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3286a490f44f9ae1e9d88a6188fed4fa62cf557f3b7587dd13863f2ddbe4e9f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1032/storytimeline_501032426.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a454af7b16e56a637786dc3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "爱丽速子想要超越极限的疯狂跑姿……\n在她抵达终点之前紧紧地抓住\n观众们的视线。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4c82bee9945d60c856fa84888a6284bb771b23c86866fe1cbd648c0b064b13a4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1032/storytimeline_501032427.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10e88918e596e335862b736d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然夺下了“天皇赏（秋）”的胜利，\n但对于抵达“可能性的尽头”，\n她觉得还缺少了些什么。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0cbce55a6279dc692aed74afc52a8d03ced8563bf6d43a0f66ef211bd4d3e17",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1032/storytimeline_501032427.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13fa243269d3d00cc909c28f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就算努力思考还是找不出答案……\n为了抵达“极限的前方”，\n寻找不足的“某项事物”的日子就此开始。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e39d083ddfbfbbb7b7d541a228437e1cea7f9e58b9cfe95ce069436722a6ccc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1032/storytimeline_501032427.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f7c2d3e729483513e383c098",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "天皇赏（秋）结束后・关于不足之处",
      "source_fingerprint": "39a930eeeacb109fa1bed5e8756bec928814bb9aa917b7e497a62a7bbe9fbe5d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1032/storytimeline_501032427.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f7ff1b3a789e2b7b5aade316",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在超越肉体的极限之后，\n爱丽速子在这个大舞台上达成夙愿，\n抵达了“可能性的尽头”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d620f697c651ec102e04a5263c6e7f3ffbeaf17e4d8874d7fea6a77b1534999",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1032/storytimeline_501032428.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6e0d9b46ac3109a33bab635",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她暂时沉浸于感慨之中……\n又因为达成目标的充实感\n放声大笑。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a4cda2ca9ffddcdbd9e2c29e87abedc94a7742e72706c4161c58ddfe9601221",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1032/storytimeline_501032428.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca1c6b8626655d852403be37",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而且对于在爱丽速子身上\n看到自己追求的目标身影的\n曼城茶座，她也展现了兴趣──",
      "source_fingerprint": "94d57844c5ea997abafc11b6d50a32d10fe46eaec72fdc1a78d04524e6e38fa8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1032/storytimeline_501032428.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae8791dc79d2a8590afbf941",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她一边露出淡淡的笑容，\n一边沉浸于要把曼城茶座\n当作下一个研究对象的疯狂想法中。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e881e8aa1926a8e14c1d8ad53b645910ae119f81205b16f3b3a44e3334d63611",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1032/storytimeline_501032428.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc1acbf25500f018f9f4496b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "有马纪念结束后・极限的尽头",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec4bfd2db65de6c0a18335bc20013768f043b83333a16482854142c240044e8e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1032/storytimeline_501032428.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f10b1fae57cdf8beebd3bf67",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我来到图书馆寻找有关赛马娘的书，\n看能不能对爱丽速子的研究帮上一点忙……",
      "source_fingerprint": "10f83d9fb88a7dbb6c6dd07380240881dc0cbd30b4fea8cc369f16d3c276dab3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1032/storytimeline_501032500.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:43120bbf5627e314b07b89c3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "爱丽速子",
